{"id":"00682","root":"uni00682_1","name":{"ja":"叢雲　いぶき","en":"Murakumo Ibuki"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"叢雲　いぶき","en":"Murakumo Ibuki"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2023-04-16","limited":false,"characterId":391,"profile":{"ja":"五車所属の学生対魔忍。生まれつきの体質で、片腕が石炭のように黒く変質している。その炭化した腕から黒煙を放ち、自由自在に操る煙遁の技を得意とする。光を通さない黒煙は隠密や攪乱に使われる他、自らの意志で成分を操作することも可能で、毒性を付加したり硬質化させて武器を作り出すことができる。五車に入学するまでは煤っぽい自らの忍法を嫌っていたが、同じ煙遁使いである紫藤凜花に檄を飛ばされて以来、卑屈に振舞うのはやめている。凜花を“お姉さま”と慕っており、彼女のように気高く強く在りたいと日々研鑽を積んでいる。人見知りで、心を開くまでは他人に強く当たりがちな性格。一人でいることも多いが、実は寂しがり屋である。感情が昂ると腕が燻りはじめることをコンプレックスに感じている。","en":"She is a Taimanin student of Gosha, born with a unique condition where one of her arms has turned black like coal. She can release black smoke from this arm, which she can manipulate freely to use her smoke concealment technique. This black smoke, which blocks out light, can be used for stealth or disruption, and she can also control its composition to add toxicity or harden it to create a weapon. Before entering Gosha, she disliked her smoky ninja techniques, but after being inspired by Shido Rinka, another smoke concealment user, she has stopped being humble. She looks up to Rinka as \"o-neesama\" and strives to become strong and noble like her every day. She is shy and tends to be harsh with others until she opens up, and she often spends time alone, but she is actually a lonely person. She is self-conscious about her arm smoking when her emotions rise."},"illustrator":"さのとしひで","voiceActor":"森谷うたね","forms":[{"id":"uni00682_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[752,1504],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[118,236],"def":[92,184],"spd":[63,63],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["1","1850009"]},{"id":"uni00682_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1104,2208],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[186,372],"def":[134,268],"spd":[63,63],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["1","1850009","1850010"]},{"id":"uni00682_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1456,2914],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[254,509],"def":[176,351],"spd":[63,63],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["1","1850009","1850010"]}],"skills":{"1":{"slot":"attack","id":1,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Superhuman damage","tag":"instant"}]},"1850009":{"slot":"skill1","id":1850009,"name":{"ja":"燻し隠れ"},"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":170,"detail":{"ja":"味方全体のSPDを小アップする"}},{"level":2,"sp":165,"detail":{"ja":"味方全体のSPDを小アップする"}},{"level":3,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"味方全体のSPDを小アップする"}},{"level":4,"sp":155,"detail":{"ja":"味方全体のSPDを小アップする"}},{"level":5,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"味方全体のSPDを小アップする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"All allies: SPD +20% for 4 turns","icon":"spd_up","tag":"buff"}]},"1850010":{"slot":"skill2","id":1850010,"name":{"ja":"黒煙裂刃"},"hits":1,"cutin":true,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に大威力で攻撃、このスキルによる攻撃のみ超特大確率で会心が発生する"}},{"level":2,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に大威力で攻撃、このスキルによる攻撃のみ超特大確率で会心が発生する"}},{"level":3,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に大威力で攻撃、このスキルによる攻撃のみ超特大確率で会心が発生する"}},{"level":4,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に大威力で攻撃、このスキルによる攻撃のみ超特大確率で会心が発生する"}},{"level":5,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に大威力で攻撃、このスキルによる攻撃のみ超特大確率で会心が発生する"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 465% Superhuman damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"This attack: crit rate +50%","tag":"modifier"}]}},"leader":{"name":{"ja":"黒煙の対魔忍"},"detail":{"ja":"敵全体のSPDを中ダウン"},"effects":[{"text":"All enemies: SPD -8%","icon":"spd_down","tag":"passive"}]},"abilities":[],"bloom":{"points":2,"gold":1,"status":1,"bonus":1,"items":[[1,"blo00001",160],[1,"blo00004",1],[2,"blo00007",15],[3,"blo00010",15],[4,"blo00013",15],[5,"blo00007",15],[6,"blo00010",15],[7,"blo00013",15],[8,"blo00007",15],[9,"blo00010",10],[9,"blo00011",10],[10,"blo00007",10],[10,"blo00008",10],[11,"blo00013",10],[11,"blo00014",10],[12,"blo00001",320],[12,"blo00004",2],[13,"blo00007",10],[13,"blo00008",10],[14,"blo00010",10],[14,"blo00011",10],[15,"blo00013",10],[15,"blo00014",10],[16,"blo00007",10],[16,"blo00008",10],[17,"blo00010",10],[17,"blo00011",10],[18,"blo00013",10],[18,"blo00014",10],[19,"blo00007",10],[19,"blo00008",10],[20,"blo00010",5],[20,"blo00011",15],[20,"blo00012",5],[21,"blo00007",5],[21,"blo00008",15],[21,"blo00009",5],[22,"blo00013",5],[22,"blo00014",15],[22,"blo00015",5],[23,"blo00010",5],[23,"blo00011",15],[23,"blo00012",5],[24,"blo00007",5],[24,"blo00008",15],[24,"blo00009",5],[25,"blo00013",5],[25,"blo00014",15],[25,"blo00015",5],[26,"blo00001",320],[26,"blo00004",1],[27,"blo00007",5],[27,"blo00010",5],[27,"blo00013",5],[28,"blo00007",5],[28,"blo00010",5],[28,"blo00013",5],[29,"blo00007",5],[29,"blo00010",5],[29,"blo00013",5],[30,"blo00007",5],[30,"blo00010",5],[30,"blo00013",5],[31,"blo00001",320],[31,"blo00004",2],[32,"blo00007",5],[32,"blo00010",5],[32,"blo00013",5],[33,"blo00007",5],[33,"blo00010",5],[33,"blo00013",5],[34,"blo00007",5],[34,"blo00010",5],[34,"blo00013",5],[35,"blo00007",5],[35,"blo00010",5],[35,"blo00013",5],[36,"blo00001",320],[36,"blo00004",2],[37,"blo00007",5],[37,"blo00010",5],[37,"blo00013",5],[38,"blo00007",5],[38,"blo00010",5],[38,"blo00013",5],[39,"blo00007",5],[39,"blo00010",5],[39,"blo00013",5],[40,"blo00007",5],[40,"blo00010",5],[40,"blo00013",5],[41,"blo00001",640],[41,"blo00004",2],[42,"blo00007",5],[42,"blo00010",5],[42,"blo00013",5],[43,"blo00007",5],[43,"blo00010",5],[43,"blo00013",5],[44,"blo00007",5],[44,"blo00010",5],[44,"blo00013",5],[45,"blo00007",5],[45,"blo00010",5],[45,"blo00013",5],[46,"blo00001",640],[46,"blo00004",2],[47,"blo00007",5],[47,"blo00009",1],[47,"blo00010",5],[47,"blo00012",1],[47,"blo00013",5],[47,"blo00015",1],[48,"blo00007",5],[48,"blo00009",1],[48,"blo00010",5],[48,"blo00012",1],[48,"blo00013",5],[48,"blo00015",1],[49,"blo00007",5],[49,"blo00009",1],[49,"blo00010",5],[49,"blo00012",1],[49,"blo00013",5],[49,"blo00015",1],[50,"blo00007",5],[50,"blo00009",1],[50,"blo00010",5],[50,"blo00012",1],[50,"blo00013",5],[50,"blo00015",1]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"煙遁使いの叢雲いぶきよ。あなたが指揮官？　まあいいわ、私の足を引っ張らないでね","en":"I'm Murakumo Ibuki, a smoke concealment user. You're my commander? Well, that's fine, just don't hold me back."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00682_1/uni00682_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"もううじうじしないって決めたんだから！　しゃんとしないと、お姉さまに顔向けできないもんね","en":"I've decided not to be so indecisive anymore! I need to shape up, or I won't be able to face o-neesama."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00682_1/uni00682_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"煙遁の術、あなたなら有効活用してくれると信じてるわ","en":"I trust you'll make good use of my smoke concealment skills."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00682_1/uni00682_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"共同鍛錬は苦手なの。一人でするからあっち行っててくんない？　み、見るだけなら自由だけど……？","en":"I'm not good with joint training. Can you just leave me alone and let me do it myself? You can watch if you want, but..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00682_1/uni00682_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"何よその顔っ、ふん、言いたいことがあるならはっきり言いなさいよ！　煙たいってさ","en":"What's with that face? Spit it out if you've got something to say! It's annoying."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00682_1/uni00682_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"凜花お姉さま、また活躍されたんだ。さすがだよね！　私も早く追いつきたい！","en":"O-neesama Rinka is amazing as always. I want to be strong like her too, and catch up to her soon."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00682_1/uni00682_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"この腕は生まれつきよ、好きでなったわけじゃないわ。……今はまあ、能力があってよかったって思ってるけど……","en":"This arm of mine is just how I was born. I didn't choose to have it this way... But I'm glad I have this ability now."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00682_1/uni00682_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"感情のコントロールの鍛錬をしてるけど、戦闘とかになるとどうしても昂ぶって腕が燻っちゃうのよね……","en":"I've been training to control my emotions, but during battles, I still get worked up and my arm starts smoking..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00682_1/uni00682_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":1,"text":{"ja":"いくら身体をボロボロにされたってぇ……ハァハァ、あなた達には屈しないわよ……！","en":"No matter how battered my body gets... I won't give in to you... Ha ha ha, I won't lose!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00682_1_hom_r18_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":2,"text":{"ja":"いやなことされてるのに、どうして気持ちいいの……！？　いやっ、こんなのおかしいでしょ……ああんっ","en":"Why does it feel so good when it's so disgusting...?! This is wrong, isn't it... Ahh..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00682_1_hom_r18_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":3,"text":{"ja":"手でチンポ擦るだけでも感じてる！？　喉もマンコみたいに使われてるのに、マンコも気持ちよくてイクぅ！","en":"Just rubbing it with my hand makes me feel it... And my throat is being used like a vagina, but my vagina feels good too, and I'm going to come!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00682_1_hom_r18_3.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00682_1/uni00682_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00682_1/uni00682_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00682_1/uni00682_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00682_1/uni00682_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00682_1/uni00682_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00682_1/uni00682_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00682_1/uni00682_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00682_1/uni00682_1_evo_2.ogg"},{"type":"lup","label":"Level Up","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00682_1/uni00682_1_lup_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00682_1/uni00682_1_msr_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00682_1/uni00682_1_msr_2.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00682_1/uni00682_1_rdy_1.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00682_1/uni00682_1_rdy_2.ogg"},{"type":"res","label":"Result","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00682_1/uni00682_1_res_1.ogg"},{"type":"wav","label":"Wave","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00682_1/uni00682_1_wav_1.ogg"}],"trust":[50],"scenes":[["chr_0530_r18"]],"stills":[["chr_0530a_r18"]],"obtain":[{"kind":"spark","title":null,"need":30,"start":"2023-04-16","end":"2023-04-30"},{"kind":"gacha","type":"Kessen","title":{"ja":"決戦ピックアップガチャ【超人】"},"start":"2025-04-01","end":"2025-04-30"}],"standardPool":true,"art":{"graphicId":"uni_00682","graphicNum":2,"r18GraphicId":"uni_00682_r18","r18GraphicNum":2,"spineId":"Chr_0530"}}